{c}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+(\\alpha {b}_{n}+\\beta {d}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nUsing the linearity property of Fourier series, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $4f(x)-g(x)$ are\n\n- $4{a}_{0}-{c}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- $4{a}_{n}-{c}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $4{b}_{n}-{d}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the $5$th sine coefficient of $4f(x)-g(x)$ is\n\n$$\n4{b}_{5}-{d}_{5}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186548050 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229173 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eb295d6c-62fe-59bc-a139-49785ac98f1f" :knowledge-point/title "Using Linearity of Fourier Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "369e06e2-73c3-5dd4-a343-09337ede43bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547429} {:answer/id #uuid "539fdd72-d074-5ca4-bc19-a05dcd278d54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{a}_{6}-2{c}_{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547504} {:answer/id #uuid "8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{b}_{6}-2{d}_{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547616} {:answer/id #uuid "af9e08fd-f24c-56c3-9400-df7628dd678d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{b}_{0}-2{d}_{0}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547698} {:answer/id #uuid "d8ef8838-eb42-5147-9f27-de7711e9fd4b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{b}_{6}-2{c}_{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547775}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3{b}_{6}-2{d}_{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186547616} :answer-field/id #uuid "b50ec26a-cc99-